From 53928306b6ae1fc7bcb98d0b3dd538168d54985f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: justinasvijeikis <80092258+justinasvijeikis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:24:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Port kernel modules to Debian 6.12

appletbdrm: guard drm_dev_set_dma_dev() (>= 6.16); PRIME import disabled below.
uvcvideo-t1: replace the 7.1.9 base with linux-source-6.12 drivers/media/usb/uvc
plus upstream/0001 (H.264 descriptors, hand-ported: 6.12 has no uvc_parse_frame())
and upstream/0002 (disable autosuspend for 05ac:8600).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 kernel/appletbdrm-t1/appletbdrm.c |   7 +
 kernel/uvcvideo-t1/uvc_ctrl.c     | 968 +++++++-----------------------
 kernel/uvcvideo-t1/uvc_debugfs.c  |   2 +-
 kernel/uvcvideo-t1/uvc_driver.c   | 525 ++++++++--------
 kernel/uvcvideo-t1/uvc_entity.c   |   4 +-
